-- (finding A47-001) and regenerated 0150_xpms_canon_seed.sql from canon/map/playbook-columns.yaml.
-- Databases that applied 0150 before that regeneration (staging) keep the old targets, so this
-- re-applies the generated rows: a fresh reset ends in the same state either way.

